{"id": "r02_01", "text": "The blue items should be placed in the leftmost bin, while anything red is to be deposited in the right-hand bin; yellow pieces are to be left where they are.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "passive", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_02", "text": "Could you kindly drop every yellow thing into the middle bin and the red stuff into the far left one? Blue can go in the bin on the right.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "question", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_03", "text": "Reds belong in the right bin, blues in the centre bin, and the yellows in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "colour_nouns", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_04", "text": "All the round ones go in the middle bin; everything else stays put on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "shape_geometry", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_05", "text": "Anything with three sides goes in the left bin, the cubes go in the right bin, and the round ones go in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape_geometry", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_06", "text": "Same as the usual setup (red left, yellow center, blue right), but swap red and blue.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "swap_default", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_07", "text": "Put every blue object in the right bin except the blue cylinders, which go in the left bin. Everything else stays on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "exception", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_08", "text": "Everything goes in the center bin, except red things, which go in the left bin - although the red triangle goes in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "nested_exception", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_09", "text": "Don't leave any yellow object on the counter: they all go to the right bin. Nothing else should be moved.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "double_negative", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_10", "text": "It's not that I don't want the blue ones sorted - I do, so put them in the middle bin. Red and yellow stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "double_negative", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_11", "text": "Both the red and the yellow cylinders go into the left bin, and each blue piece goes in the right one.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "quantifier", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_12", "text": "Any triangle, whatever its colour, goes in the centre bin; any cube goes in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "quantifier", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_13", "text": "Task list: 1) yellow -> left bin 2) red -> right bin 3) blue -> leave on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "numbered_list", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_14", "text": "- reds: middle bin - blues: middle bin too - yellows: left bin", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "bullet_list", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_15", "text": "Yesterday the robot dumped everything in one bin and we had to redo it all. Today, please be careful: the blue cubes go in the left bin, the yellow cubes in the right bin, and nothing else gets touched.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "story", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_16", "text": "Hi! Note from Sam: I've set things up differently for the demo, so please follow this: red to the center bin, blue to the left bin, yellow to the right bin. Thanks, S.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "colleague_note", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_17", "text": "Place the scarlet pieces in the centre bin and the navy ones in the left-hand bin; the lemon-coloured bits go in the right-hand bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "synonyms_british", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_18", "text": "Plase put the yelow cilinders in the rigth bin and the bleu triangels in the midle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "typos", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_19", "text": "put red cubez in teh lefft bin, evrything else in the centre bin", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "typos", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_20", "text": "Red objects normally go to the left bin, but today they should go to the right bin; yellow goes to the left bin and blue to the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "contrastive", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_21", "text": "If you see any blue cylinders, put them in the left bin. If you see red objects of any shape, they go in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "conditional", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_22", "text": "Put the yellow things (yes, including the yellow triangles, even though they look a bit orange under this light) in the left bin, and the blue things in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "parenthetical", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_23", "text": "Once you've cleared the red cubes into the center bin, which should be the first thing you do, go ahead and take the remaining red pieces to the right bin, and then, assuming nothing has gone wrong, the blue cylinders can go to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "long_sentence", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_24", "text": "Yellow triangles to the left bin, blue triangles to the right bin, and whatever remains goes in the middle bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "the_rest", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_25", "text": "Send all cylinders to the right bin. All other objects stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "shape_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_26", "text": "Don't put the red objects anywhere; they stay. Put the yellow ones in the right bin and the blue ones in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "negation", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_27", "text": "The blue triangles go not in the left bin but in the center bin; the rest of the blue pieces go in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "negation", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_28", "text": "Everything except yellow goes into the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "exception", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_29", "text": "Everything but the cylinders goes in the left bin; the cylinders go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "exception", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_30", "text": "Cubes in the center bin, please.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "shape_only", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_31", "text": "The red and blue triangles go in the left bin, the yellow triangle goes in the right bin, and all cubes go in the centre bin. Cylinders stay where they are.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape_colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_32", "text": "Okay so, um, I was thinking about this all morning, and honestly I think the cleanest way is just to have the yellow stuff in the right bin, red in the left bin, and, uh, blue in the middle one. Does that make sense? Great, go for it.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "rambling", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_33", "text": "Would you be so kind as to gather up all of the blue cylinders and the blue cubes and place them, gently if you can, into the bin in the middle? I'd really appreciate it.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "polite", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_34", "text": "Only the red triangles need sorting today - they go to the left bin. Please leave all other items on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "leave_on_counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_35", "text": "Red and yellow both go into the right bin; blue goes into the right bin as well.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "right", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "shared_bin", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_36", "text": "Bin assignments for this run: yellow on the right, blue in the center and red on the left.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "one_bin_per_colour", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_37", "text": "Put the blue pieces in the first bin from the left and the red pieces in the third bin from the left; the yellow pieces go in the second one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "ordinal_bins", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_38", "text": "Put the red stuff in the bin immediately to the right of the middle one, and the yellow stuff in the bin at the opposite end. Blue stays on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "relative_bins", "adversarial": false}
