{"id": "r02_40", "text": "The yellow ones go in the same bin as the red ones, and the red ones go in the right bin. Blue goes in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "forward_reference", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_41", "text": "No red objects in the center bin: the red objects go in the left bin. Blue objects in the center bin, yellow objects in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "negation", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_42", "text": "Put the cylinders, except the red one, in the right bin. Red goes in the left bin - all of it, including that cylinder.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "exception", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_43", "text": "The center bin gets nothing red and nothing blue, only yellow. Red goes in the right bin, blue in the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "center", "yellow/triangle": "center", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "negation", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_44", "text": "Before I go blue in the face explaining this again: yellow goes in the left bin, red goes in the right bin, and the blue objects go in the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "idiom", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_45", "text": "Put the yellow cubes in the left bin and the cylinders in the center bin, but the yellow cylinders go in the right bin instead.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "specific_override", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_46", "text": "Red objects: right bin. Not the left one, not the middle one - the right one. Yellow and blue: leave them on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "right", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "negation", "adversarial": true}
{"id": "r02_47", "text": "Red into the left bin, yellow into the center bin... scratch that last part, yellow into the right bin. Blue into the center bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "center", "blue/triangle": "center"}, "category": "self_correction", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_48", "text": "Take a left-to-right view of the bins: the yellow pieces go in the bin at the right end, the red pieces in the bin at the left end, and the blue pieces nowhere - they stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "bin_synonyms", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_49", "text": "The triangles are the only things staying on the counter; the cubes go to the center bin and the cylinders to the left bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": null, "blue/cube": "center", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "leave_on_counter", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_50", "text": "The left bin is to be filled with cubes of every colour, and the yellow triangles are to be put in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "passive", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_51", "text": "Chuck the reds in the centre bin and toss the blues in the left one; the yellows go into the right one.", "gt": {"red/cube": "center", "red/cylinder": "center", "red/triangle": "center", "yellow/cube": "right", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "left", "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "verbs", "adversarial": false}
