{"id": "r02_57", "text": "The yellow wedges and the blue wedges go in the left bin; the red wedge goes in the right bin. Nothing else moves.", "gt": {"red/cube": null, "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": null, "yellow/cylinder": null, "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": "left"}, "category": "shape_synonyms", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_58", "text": "If an object is yellow or is a cube, it goes in the left bin; nothing else moves.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": null, "red/triangle": null, "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": null, "blue/triangle": null}, "category": "conditional", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_59", "text": "Since the right bin is a bit wobbly today, nothing heavy should go in it: put the blue and red cubes in the left bin and the yellow cubes in the center bin. The lighter cylinders and triangles, whatever their colour, can all go in the right bin.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "right", "red/triangle": "right", "yellow/cube": "center", "yellow/cylinder": "right", "yellow/triangle": "right", "blue/cube": "left", "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "long_sentence", "adversarial": false}
{"id": "r02_60", "text": "Everything goes in the left bin apart from the blue things, which go in the right bin - and apart from the blue cubes, which stay on the counter.", "gt": {"red/cube": "left", "red/cylinder": "left", "red/triangle": "left", "yellow/cube": "left", "yellow/cylinder": "left", "yellow/triangle": "left", "blue/cube": null, "blue/cylinder": "right", "blue/triangle": "right"}, "category": "nested_exception", "adversarial": false}
